<bblocks://ogch.registry.reportedPropertyColumns> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "Reported-Property-Column Specification Registry" ;
    dct:abstract "Registry of reusable schema:PropertyValueSpecification reported-property column definitions derived from technique TAPP workbooks. Each $def constrains one column of the reported-property table -- the variables a procedure REPORTS, as distinct from the analytes and channels it acquires. TAPP building blocks reference these definitions via fragment $refs so they resolve locally through the building-block register. The root only hosts $defs; it has no instantiable properties of its own. TAPP building blocks reference these definitions via fragment $refs so they resolve locally through the register."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
