<bblocks://ogch.BaseSchema.modules.aggregation> a skos:Concept,
        dcat:Dataset,
        bblocks:BBlock,
        bblocks:Schema ;
    rdfs:label "TAPP Composition Module: Aggregation" ;
    dct:abstract "The shared Aggregation block of the 2026-08-11 TAPP library, composed by 13 of the sixteen delivery tables. 2 owned fields over 2 schema paths, split into the procedure and analysis halves a TAPP schema and a technique detail compose respectively. A profile over existing tappDefinition/adaProduct properties, not a new vocabulary. Generated from the module CSV and its schema-path sidecar."^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:created "2026-08-21T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
